## Modules

- Dashboard
- Apply Leave
- My Requests
- Manager Approval
- Leave Calendar
- Reports
- Organization Settings
- User & Role Management
- Security Settings
- Backup & Restore

## Approval Workflow

Employee submits leave request  
↓  
Power Automate triggers approval  
↓  
Manager reviews the request  
↓  
Manager approves or rejects  
↓  
SharePoint status is updated  
↓  
Employee views the updated request status

## Key Functionality

- Create, edit, and delete leave requests
- Manager approval and rejection
- Leave status tracking
- File attachments
- Search and filtering
- Pagination
- Leave calendar
- Dashboard and reports
- SharePoint data integration
- Automated approval workflow

